WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.541
Hope is not a plan.

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:06.416
In order to have a real plan,
there needs to be real rigor.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.416
I'd like to approach

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:12.458
strategic thinking in this class
by giving you this toolkit

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:15.125
so you can confront
whatever decisions that you have to make.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:18.416
In 2014,

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:20.541
DreamWorks
had a couple of movies not work out,

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.208
so we were showing some losses.

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:26.166
Our stock price was down a lot
and we tried to ask ourselves,

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:29.458
what is the best future for a business
like this?

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:34.541
And so when you're making strategic
decisions, it's very important

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:35.833
to understand the connection

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.875
between the decision you make
and the strategic outcome.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.666
If you have a strategy,
that is your end goal.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.291
The decision is your tactic.

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:49.583
I'm Mellody Hobson,
and this is MasterClass.

